# Keep licensed source feeds, private account material and local intermediates out.
# Only deliberately selected public research outputs belong in this repository.
# Exclusions are a publication boundary, not a blanket interpretation or grant of
# redistribution rights; see docs/DATA_RIGHTS.md for scope and responsibilities.
